<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-PT">
  <head>
    <%- include('partials/public-head', { title: 'Parcerias', description: 'As parcerias por trás da Quick Menu — a ORYA Creative Studio desenha todos os nossos cartões.' }) %>
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen text-neutral-200">
    <%- include('partials/public-nav') %>

    <main>
      <section class="relative overflow-hidden px-4 pb-24 pt-16 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-6 -z-10 h-56 w-[32rem] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-b-full bg-gradient-to-b from-teal-400/25 to-transparent blur-3xl"></div>

        <div class="mb-10 flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
          <span class="h-px w-8 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent to-teal-500"></span>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-teal-400">Parcerias</p>
          <span class="h-px w-8 bg-gradient-to-l from-transparent to-teal-500"></span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-5xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight text-white sm:text-6xl">
          Criatividade <span class="text-teal-400">×</span> Tecnologia
        </h1>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-7 text-neutral-300">
          A Quick Menu trata da tecnologia. O design de cada cartão é obra da nossa parceira principal.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pb-24 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/[0.08] to-white/[0.02] backdrop-blur-sm p-10 shadow-xl shadow-black/30">
          <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="h-px w-8 bg-teal-500"></span>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-teal-400">Parceira Principal de Design</p>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">ORYA Creative Studio</h2>
          <ul class="mt-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-neutral-400">
            <li>&bull; Design</li>
            <li>&bull; Branding</li>
            <li>&bull; Identidade Visual</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-6 text-neutral-300">
            Todos os cartões Quick Menu — de restaurantes e pessoais — são desenhados pela ORYA Creative Studio.
            É a nossa parceira de sempre, responsável por transformar cada ideia num cartão com identidade própria.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm font-medium">
            <a
              href="https://www.instagram.com/orya.creativestudio/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener"
              class="rounded-full bg-gradient-to-t from-teal-950 to-teal-500 px-4 py-2 text-white shadow-lg shadow-teal-900/30 transition hover:to-teal-400"
            >
              Instagram
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://www.etsy.com/shop/OryaCreativeStudioCo"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener"
              class="rounded-full border border-white/15 px-4 py-2 text-neutral-300 transition hover:border-teal-400/50 hover:text-teal-300"
            >
              Loja Etsy
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/public-footer') %>
  </body>
</html>
